          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir oyun değişkeninin değerini görüntülemek için <code>console.log()</code> metodunu ne zaman kullanabiliriz?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Değişkeni oluşturduktan sonra</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Değişkeni oluşturmadan önce</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Değişkeni oluşturmadan önce veya oluşturduktan sonra</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Değişkeni oluşturduktan sonra.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu neden bir dize değeri değil?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"Boss Level\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Etrafında çift tırnak olmadığı için</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kelimeler arasında boşluk olduğu için</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kelimeler büyük harfle yazıldığı için</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Etrafında çift tırnak olmadığı için.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145255,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>=</code> işaretini kullanarak <code>playerShip</code> değişkenine <code>\"Falcon\"</code> dize değerini ata.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerShip = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Falcon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145256,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsolda <code>Game Over</code> görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Game Over\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>console.log</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>\"Game Over\"</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145257,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dize değerini konsolda görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUp = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield, Speed, and Double Damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(powerUp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>console.log</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>powerUp</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145258,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"1400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerShield = \" /><text value=\"900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerShield = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerShield);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1500</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>900</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1000</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145259,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsolda <code>maxEnemies</code> eksi <code>enemiesDefeated</code> değerini görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"121\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxEnemies = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesDefeated = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(maxEnemies - enemiesDefeated);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>maxEnemies</code>, ardından <code>-</code> ve son olarak <code>enemiesDefeated</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145260,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>totalScore</code> değerini konsolda görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"116\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" baseScore = \" /><text value=\"1084\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonusPoints = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalScore = baseScore + bonusPoints;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalScore);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>totalScore</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145261,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>totalScore</code>'u <code>score</code> eksi <code>deathPenalty</code> sonucuna ayarla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"1084\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" deathPenalty = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalScore = score - deathPenalty;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>score</code>, ardından <code>-</code> ve son olarak <code>deathPenalty</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145262,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>finalHealth</code> değerinin değeri nedir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraDamage = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalHealth = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"finalHealth = damage + extraDamage;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>7</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
