            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seçilen sayının <code>0</code>'a eşit olmadığını kontrol et.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chosenLevel = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" notZero = chosenLevel !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(notZero);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>!</code> ve son olarak <code>0</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
